WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.941
The one-card tarot spread is one question
and one card.

00:00:04.941 --> 00:00:08.070
It is the quickest way to start reading
tarot.

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:11.404
How the one-card spread works.

00:00:11.404 --> 00:00:17.097
You shuffle the deck while holding a question in
mind, then turn over a single card.

00:00:17.097 --> 00:00:22.588
The card's position is the question itself, so
there is nothing else to remember.

00:00:23.888 --> 00:00:25.311
How to lay it out.

00:00:25.311 --> 00:00:29.739
Choose a question, shuffle, draw one card,
then read it.

00:00:31.139 --> 00:00:33.512
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:33.512 --> 00:00:38.323
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
